    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "Solve the following inequalities.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p76-g40-43-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$2<|x-3|<4$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$-1<x<1$ or $5<x<7$",
          "worked": "The distance of $x$ from $3$ is more than $2$ and less than $4$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}-4&<x-3<-2\\quad\\text{or}\\quad 2<x-3<4\\\\-1&<x<1\\quad\\text{or}\\quad 5<x<7\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      },
      {
        "id": "p76-g40-43-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$1\\le |x+2|\\le 3$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$-5\\le x\\le -3$ or $-1\\le x\\le 1$",
          "worked": "The distance of $x$ from $-2$ is at least $1$ and at most $3$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}-3&\\le x+2\\le -1\\quad\\text{or}\\quad 1\\le x+2\\le 3\\\\-5&\\le x\\le -3\\quad\\text{or}\\quad -1\\le x\\le 1\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      },
      {
        "id": "p76-g40-43-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$3<|4-x|\\le 7$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$-3\\le x<1$ or $7<x\\le 11$",
          "worked": "Since $|4-x|=|x-4|$, the distance of $x$ from $4$ is more than $3$ and at most $7$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}-7&\\le x-4<-3\\quad\\text{or}\\quad 3<x-4\\le 7\\\\-3&\\le x<1\\quad\\text{or}\\quad 7<x\\le 11\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p76-g40-43-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$3\\le |2x-1|<7$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$-3<x\\le -1$ or $2\\le x<4$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3}{2}&\\le \\left|x-\\frac{1}{2}\\right|<\\frac{7}{2}\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe distance of $x$ from $\\frac{1}{2}$ is at least $\\frac{3}{2}$ and less than $\\frac{7}{2}$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}-\\frac{7}{2}&<x-\\frac{1}{2}\\le -\\frac{3}{2}\\quad\\text{or}\\quad \\frac{3}{2}\\le x-\\frac{1}{2}<\\frac{7}{2}\\\\-3&<x\\le -1\\quad\\text{or}\\quad 2\\le x<4\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 48
      }
    ]
  },
